  "termsIntroTitle": "1. Introduction and Acceptance",
  "termsIntroContent": "Welcome to Taksh, operated by TAKSH ALL IN ONE ECOMMERCE & LOGISTICS WITH MULTI SERVICES PRIVATE LIMITED (\"Taksh\", \"we\", \"us\"). These Terms & Conditions govern your use of our mobile application and related services (the \"Platform\"). By downloading, registering or using the Platform, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the Platform.\n\nYou must be at least 18 years old and legally able to enter into a contract under the Indian Contract Act, 1872. Minors may use the Platform only under the supervision of a parent or guardian.",
  "termsAccountTitle": "2. Account Registration",
  "termsAccountContent": "You sign in with your mobile number, verified by a One-Time Password (OTP). You agree to:\n\n• Provide accurate and complete information\n• Keep your device and OTP confidential and never share your OTP with anyone\n• Tell us immediately if you suspect unauthorised use\n• Accept responsibility for all activity under your account\n\nWe may suspend or close accounts that give false information or break these Terms.",
  "termsUserRespTitle": "3. User Responsibilities",
  "termsUserRespContent": "As a user of the Platform, you agree to:\n\n• Use it only for lawful purposes\n• Not provide false information or pretend to be someone else\n• Not misuse offers, coupons or referral benefits\n• Not post abusive, misleading or unlawful reviews or content\n• Not copy, scrape or interfere with the Platform or try to gain unauthorised access to our systems\n• Not infringe the intellectual property rights of others",
  "termsProductsTitle": "4. Products and Pricing",
  "termsProductsContent": "We try to show accurate product descriptions, images, prices and availability. However:\n\n• Images are for illustration and colour or packaging may differ slightly\n• All prices are in Indian Rupees (INR) and include applicable taxes unless stated otherwise\n• Delivery or handling charges, if any, are shown before you place the order\n• Prices, offers and availability may change without notice; the price shown when you place the order applies\n• If a product is listed at a wrong price because of a technical or typing error, we may cancel the order and refund any amount paid",
  "termsOrdersTitle": "5. Orders",
  "termsOrdersContent": "• Placing an order is an offer to buy. A contract is formed only when we confirm your order\n• You confirm that the details you give (including your delivery address and phone number) are correct\n• We may cancel or refuse an order if stock is unavailable, there is a pricing error, fraud is suspected or the address cannot be served. If you have already paid, we will refund you\n• Quantity limits may apply to some products",
  "termsPaymentTitle": "6. Payments",
  "termsPaymentContent": "• You can pay online through our payment gateway (UPI, cards, net banking or wallets) or choose Cash on Delivery where available\n• Online payments are processed by a third-party payment gateway. We do not store your card number, CVV, UPI PIN or banking passwords\n• You confirm that you are authorised to use the payment method you choose\n• If money is debited but the order is not confirmed, the amount is normally reversed automatically within 5 to 7 working days. If it is not, please contact us with the transaction details\n• For Cash on Delivery, please keep the payment ready at delivery. We may limit or disable Cash on Delivery for accounts with repeated refused or undelivered orders",
  "termsShippingTitle": "7. Delivery",
  "termsShippingContent": "• Delivery options (Express 30-minute, Next-Day and Standard) depend on your location and product availability\n• Delivery times are estimates, not guarantees. Delays can happen due to weather, traffic, high demand or other events beyond our control\n• Please give a complete and correct address and keep your phone reachable. We are not responsible for failed delivery caused by wrong or incomplete details\n• Please check your items at delivery and report any problem as soon as possible\n• Risk of loss passes to you on delivery",
  "termsCancelTitle": "8. Cancellations",
  "termsCancelContent": "• You can cancel an order before it is dispatched, from the app or by contacting us\n• Once an order is dispatched it cannot be cancelled, but it may be returned as per our Refund & Return Policy\n• Prepaid orders cancelled before dispatch are refunded as described in our Refund & Return Policy",
  "termsReturnsTitle": "9. Returns and Refunds",
  "termsReturnsContent": "Returns, replacements and refunds are governed by our Refund & Return Policy, which is part of these Terms. In short:\n\n• Return requests must be raised in the app within the return window shown for the product\n• Items must be unused and in their original condition and packaging\n• Some items cannot be returned, as listed in the policy\n• Approved refunds for returned items are credited to your Taksh wallet",
  "termsOffersTitle": "10. Offers and Third-Party Sellers",
  "termsOffersContent": "• Offers, discounts and coupons are subject to their own terms, validity and usage limits and may be withdrawn or changed at any time\n• Some products are sold by third-party sellers and delivered through our fulfillment centers or delivery partners. Taksh facilitates the sale and, where applicable, the seller's details are shown on the product page\n• The Platform may link to third-party services. We are not responsible for their content or practices",
  "termsIpTitle": "11. Intellectual Property",
  "termsIpContent": "All content on the Platform, including logos, trademarks, text, graphics, images and software, belongs to Taksh or its licensors and is protected by Indian intellectual property laws. You may not copy, modify, distribute or use it commercially without our written permission.",
  "termsPrivacyTitle": "12. Privacy and Data Protection",
  "termsPrivacyContent": "Your privacy matters to us. We collect and use your personal data as described in our Privacy Policy. By using the Platform, you consent to that collection and use.",
  "termsLiabilityTitle": "13. Limitation of Liability",
  "termsLiabilityContent": "To the extent permitted by law:\n\n• The Platform is provided \"as is\" and \"as available\". We do not promise that it will always be uninterrupted or error-free\n• We are not liable for indirect or consequential losses\n• Our total liability for any claim about an order is limited to the amount you paid for that order\n• Manufacturer warranties, if any, are given by the manufacturer\n\nNothing in these Terms limits your rights under the Consumer Protection Act, 2019.",
  "termsIndemnifyTitle": "14. Indemnification",
  "termsIndemnifyContent": "You agree to compensate and hold Taksh harmless against claims, losses and expenses that arise from your breach of these Terms or your violation of any law or the rights of others.",
  "termsModTitle": "15. Changes to These Terms",
  "termsModContent": "We may update these Terms from time to time. The updated Terms will be shown in the app with a new \"Last Updated\" date. If you continue to use the Platform after the change, you accept the updated Terms.",
  "termsTerminationTitle": "16. Suspension and Termination",
  "termsTerminationContent": "We may suspend or end your access if you break these Terms, misuse the Platform or the law requires it. You may stop using the Platform and delete your account at any time. Rights and obligations that arose before termination continue.",
  "termsLawTitle": "17. Governing Law and Jurisdiction",
  "termsLawContent": "These Terms are governed by the laws of India. Subject to your rights as a consumer under applicable law, the courts at Bhopal, Madhya Pradesh will have jurisdiction over disputes.",
  "termsGrievanceTitle": "18. Grievance Officer",
  "termsGrievanceContent": "In line with the Information Technology Act, 2000 and the Consumer Protection (E-Commerce) Rules, 2020, you can send complaints to our Grievance Officer:\n\nGrievance Officer\nTAKSH ALL IN ONE ECOMMERCE & LOGISTICS WITH MULTI SERVICES PRIVATE LIMITED\nEmail: customersupport@takshallinone.in\nAddress: Bhopal, Madhya Pradesh, India\n\nWe acknowledge complaints within 48 hours and aim to resolve them within one month.",
  "termsContactTitle": "19. Contact Us",
  "termsContactContent": "For any question about these Terms, contact us:\n\nEmail: customersupport@takshallinone.in\nAddress: Bhopal, Madhya Pradesh, India",
  "termsAck": "By using Taksh, you confirm that you have read and understood these Terms & Conditions.",
  "refundCommitmentTitle": "Our Commitment",
  "refundCommitmentContent": "At Taksh E-Commerce we want you to be happy with every order. If something is wrong with your order, this policy explains how returns, replacements, cancellations and refunds work.",
  "refundReadPolicy": "Please read this policy carefully. It is part of our Terms & Conditions.",
  "refundEligibilityTitle": "1. Return Eligibility",
  "refundEligibilityContent": "You can request a return within the return window of the product, counted from the date of delivery. The window is shown on the product page and is 7 days unless stated otherwise. You can request a return if:",
  "refundEligibilityItem1": "You received a wrong, damaged or defective item, or one that is different from its description",
  "refundEligibilityItem2": "Parts, accessories or quantity are missing from your order",
  "refundEligibilityItem3": "There is a size, fit or colour issue (where the product allows it)",
  "refundEligibilityItem4": "The item is unused, with original packaging, tags and labels intact",
  "refundEligibilityItem5": "You raise the request in the app with a reason and clear photos",
  "refundNonReturnableTitle": "2. Non-Returnable Items",
  "refundNonReturnableContent": "The following items cannot be returned, unless they arrive damaged, defective or wrong:",
  "refundNonReturnableItem1": "Perishable goods such as fresh food, fruits and vegetables",
  "refundNonReturnableItem2": "Opened or used personal care, hygiene and intimate items",
  "refundNonReturnableItem3": "Customised or personalised items",
  "refundNonReturnableItem4": "Digital products, gift cards and vouchers",
  "refundNonReturnableItem5": "Products marked \"non-returnable\" on the product page",
  "refundNonReturnableItem6": "Items damaged through misuse after delivery",
  "refundProcessTitle": "3. Return Process",
  "refundProcessContent": "Follow these steps to return an item:",
  "refundStep1Title": "Raise a Return Request",
  "refundStep1Desc": "Go to \"Your Orders\", select the item and tap Return. Choose a reason, add up to 5 photos and submit.",
  "refundStep2Title": "Request Review",
  "refundStep2Desc": "Our team reviews your request, usually within 24 to 48 hours. You can see the status in the app.",
  "refundStep3Title": "Pack the Item",
  "refundStep3Desc": "Keep the item in its original packaging with all accessories, tags and the invoice.",
  "refundStep4Title": "Pickup and Resolution",
  "refundStep4Desc": "If approved, we will arrange a pickup or tell you how to send the item back. After it is received and checked, your refund or replacement is processed.",
  "refundTimelineTitle": "4. Refund Timeline",
  "refundTimelineContent": "A typical timeline after your return request is approved (actual time may vary by location and product):",
  "refundTimelineItem1Day": "Day 1-2",
  "refundTimelineItem1Desc": "Item picked up or received and quality check started",
  "refundTimelineItem2Day": "Day 3-4",
  "refundTimelineItem2Desc": "Quality check completed and refund approved",
  "refundTimelineItem3Day": "Day 5-7",
  "refundTimelineItem3Desc": "Refund credited to your Taksh wallet or replacement dispatched",
  "refundProcessingNote": "These timelines are estimates. Delays can happen during sale periods and holidays or when extra verification is needed.",
  "refundMethodsTitle": "5. How You Get Your Money Back",
  "refundMethodsContent": "Depending on your case, your request is settled in one of these ways:",
  "refundMethodOriginalTitle": "Taksh Wallet Credit",
  "refundMethodOriginalDesc": "Refunds for approved returns are credited to your Taksh wallet and can be used on future orders",
  "refundMethodOriginalDays": "After check",
  "refundMethodCreditTitle": "Replacement",
  "refundMethodCreditDesc": "The same item is sent again, subject to stock availability",
  "refundMethodCreditDays": "Subject to stock",
  "refundMethodBankTitle": "Original Payment Method",
  "refundMethodBankDesc": "Prepaid orders cancelled before dispatch are refunded to the card, UPI or bank account used to pay",
  "refundMethodBankDays": "5-7 days",
  "refundDamagedTitle": "6. Damaged or Defective Products",
  "refundDamagedContent": "If you receive a damaged or defective product:\n\n• Report it in the app as soon as possible, ideally within 48 hours of delivery and always within the return window\n• Add clear photos of the item and its packaging\n• After verification we will offer a replacement or refund\n• For perishable items, please report at the time of delivery or within 24 hours",
  "refundWrongTitle": "7. Wrong Product Delivered",
  "refundWrongContent": "If you receive the wrong product:\n\n• Raise a return in the app with photos\n• We will not charge you for a return that results from our error\n• We will send the correct item, subject to stock\n• If the correct item is not available, you will be refunded",
  "refundPartialTitle": "8. Partial Refunds",
  "refundPartialContent": "In some cases only a part of the amount may be refunded:",
  "refundPartialItem1": "The item shows signs of use or minor damage not caused by us",
  "refundPartialItem2": "Accessories, tags or original packaging are missing",
  "refundPartialItem3": "Only a part of the order is affected or returned",
  "refundPartialItem4": "Free or promotional items that came with the order are not returned",
  "refundExchangeTitle": "9. Replacement",
  "refundExchangeContent": "When you raise a return, you can ask for a replacement instead of a refund. We send the same item again, subject to stock. If it is not available, the amount is refunded to your Taksh wallet.",
  "refundCancelTitle": "10. Cancellation Policy",
  "refundCancelContent": "You can cancel an order before it is dispatched, from the app or by contacting us:\n\n• No cancellation charges before dispatch\n• Prepaid orders are refunded to the original payment method, usually within 5 to 7 working days (your bank's timelines may vary)\n• Cash on Delivery orders have nothing to refund\n• After dispatch an order cannot be cancelled, but you may return it as per this policy\n• If an order is refused at delivery or cannot be delivered because of a wrong address, it may be cancelled and delivery charges may be deducted from any refund",
  "refundContactTitle": "11. Contact for Returns",
  "refundContactContent": "Need help with a return or refund? Email us at customersupport@takshallinone.in with your order number and we will get back to you as soon as possible.\n\nThis policy does not affect your rights under the Consumer Protection Act, 2019.",
  "refundSatisfactionTitle": "We're Here to Help",
  "refundSatisfactionContent": "If something is not right with your order, tell us and we will work with you to fix it.",
  "privacyIntroTitle": "Introduction",
  "privacyIntroContent": "TAKSH ALL IN ONE ECOMMERCE & LOGISTICS WITH MULTI SERVICES PRIVATE LIMITED (\"Taksh\", \"we\", \"us\") respects your privacy. This policy explains what personal data we collect through our mobile app, why we collect it, how we use, share and protect it, and the choices you have. It follows the Information Technology Act, 2000, the IT (Reasonable Security Practices and Procedures) Rules, 2011 and the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023.",
  "privacyAgreeContent": "By using our app and giving consent where we ask for it, you agree to the practices described in this policy.",
  "privacyCollectTitle": "1. Information We Collect",
  "privacyCollectContent": "We collect only the information we need to run the app and deliver your orders:",
  "privacyPersonalTitle": "Information You Give Us",
  "privacyPersonalContent": "• Name and mobile number (used to sign you in with an OTP)\n• Email address, if you provide it\n• Delivery addresses and pincode\n• Profile details you choose to add",
  "privacyUsageTitle": "Device and Usage Data",
  "privacyUsageContent": "• Device information (model, operating system, app version)\n• Location, only with your permission, to show what can be delivered to you\n• App activity and crash reports, to fix problems\n• A notification token, to send you order updates",
  "privacyTransactionTitle": "Order and Payment Data",
  "privacyTransactionContent": "• Orders, delivery and return details\n• Payment status and transaction reference. Card, UPI and bank details are handled by our payment gateway and are not stored by us\n• Photos you upload with a return request\n• Reviews and ratings you submit",
  "privacyUseTitle": "2. How We Use Your Information",
  "privacyUseContent": "We use your information to:",
  "privacyUseItem1": "Create your account and verify you with an OTP",
  "privacyUseItem2": "Process, deliver and track your orders",
  "privacyUseItem3": "Handle payments, cancellations, returns and refunds",
  "privacyUseItem4": "Provide customer support and answer your queries",
  "privacyUseItem5": "Send order updates and important notifications",
  "privacyUseItem6": "Show products and delivery options available at your location",
  "privacyUseItem7": "Send offers and promotions, only if you have agreed",
  "privacyUseItem8": "Improve the app and keep it secure, and detect and prevent fraud",
  "privacyUseItem9": "Comply with legal obligations",
  "privacySharingTitle": "3. Sharing of Information",
  "privacySharingContent": "We do not sell your personal data. We share it only in these cases:",
  "privacyProvidersTitle": "Service Providers",
  "privacyProvidersContent": "Payment gateways, SMS and notification providers, cloud hosting and analytics providers who process data for us under confidentiality obligations.",
  "privacyPartnersTitle": "Sellers and Delivery Partners",
  "privacyPartnersContent": "Sellers, fulfillment centers and delivery partners receive your name, address, phone number and order details only to prepare and deliver your order.",
  "privacyLegalTitle": "Legal Requirements",
  "privacyLegalContent": "When required by law, a court order or a request from a government authority, or to protect the rights and safety of our users and Taksh.",
  "privacyTransferTitle": "Business Transfers",
  "privacyTransferContent": "If Taksh is merged with or acquired by another business, your data may be transferred to it, and we will tell you before it becomes subject to a different policy.",
  "privacySecurityTitle": "4. Data Security",
  "privacySecurityContent": "We use reasonable technical and organisational safeguards to protect your data:\n\n• Encryption of data in transit\n• Access controls and authentication\n• Access limited to authorised personnel\n• Payments handled by a secure payment gateway",
  "privacySecurityNote": "No method of transmission or storage is 100% secure. Please never share your OTP with anyone.",
  "privacyRightsTitle": "5. Your Rights",
  "privacyRightsContent": "Subject to applicable law, you have the right to:",
  "privacyRightsItem1": "Access: ask what personal data we hold about you",
  "privacyRightsItem2": "Correction: update or correct inaccurate data",
  "privacyRightsItem3": "Erasure: delete your account and data, from the app or by emailing us",
  "privacyRightsItem4": "Withdraw consent at any time",
  "privacyRightsItem5": "Opt out of promotional messages",
  "privacyRightsItem6": "Nominate a person to exercise your rights in case of your death or incapacity",
  "privacyRightsItem7": "Raise a grievance with our Grievance Officer",
  "privacyCookiesTitle": "6. App Permissions",
  "privacyCookiesContent": "The app may ask for these permissions:\n\n• Location: to show delivery availability near you\n• Notifications: for order updates and offers\n• Camera and photos: to add images to a return request or profile\n\nYou can change any permission in your device settings. Some features may not work without them.",
  "privacyLinksTitle": "7. Third-Party Links",
  "privacyLinksContent": "The app may link to third-party websites or services. We are not responsible for their privacy practices, so please read their policies.",
  "privacyChildrenTitle": "8. Children's Privacy",
  "privacyChildrenContent": "Our service is meant for people aged 18 and above. We do not knowingly collect personal data of children without a parent's or guardian's consent. If you think a child has given us data, please contact us and we will delete it.",
  "privacyRetentionTitle": "9. Data Retention",
  "privacyRetentionContent": "We keep your data while your account is active and as long as needed to provide our services. After that we keep only what the law requires, such as invoices and transaction records, or what is needed to resolve disputes. We then delete or anonymise it.",
  "privacyInternationalTitle": "10. Data Storage and Transfers",
  "privacyInternationalContent": "Our service providers may store or process data on servers in or outside India. Where data is processed outside India, we take steps to make sure it stays protected as required by law.",
  "privacyChangesTitle": "11. Changes to This Policy",
  "privacyChangesContent": "We may update this policy from time to time. The new version will be shown in the app with a new \"Last Updated\" date.",
  "privacyContactTitle": "12. Contact and Grievance Officer",
  "privacyContactContent": "For questions, requests or complaints about your data, contact our Grievance Officer:\n\nGrievance Officer\nTAKSH ALL IN ONE ECOMMERCE & LOGISTICS WITH MULTI SERVICES PRIVATE LIMITED\nEmail: customersupport@takshallinone.in\nAddress: Bhopal, Madhya Pradesh, India\n\nWe acknowledge requests within 48 hours and aim to resolve them within one month.",
  "privacyMattersTitle": "Your Privacy Matters",
  "privacyMattersContent": "We handle your data responsibly and only for the purposes described here.",
  "ourStoryContent": "Taksh is a shopping app operated by TAKSH ALL IN ONE ECOMMERCE & LOGISTICS WITH MULTI SERVICES PRIVATE LIMITED, built to bring everyday products to your doorstep quickly and reliably. We work with local sellers and fulfillment centers, so you can choose Express delivery in 30 minutes in select areas, Next-Day delivery or Standard delivery, and pay online or with Cash on Delivery where available.",
  "ourMissionContent": "To make everyday shopping simple, fast and trustworthy, with clear prices, genuine products and honest service, while supporting local businesses.",
  "ourVisionContent": "To be a shopping app that people across India trust for their daily needs, where they can find what they want and get it when they need it.",
  "trustTransparencyDesc": "Clear prices, clear policies and honest communication at every step.",
  "qualityFirstDesc": "We work with sellers and partners to offer genuine products in good condition.",
  "customerCentricityDesc": "Our customers are at the heart of everything we do. Your feedback shapes how we improve.",
  "sustainabilityDesc": "We work with local sellers and fulfillment centers to deliver faster and support local businesses.",
  "innovationDesc": "We keep improving our app and services to make shopping easier.",
  "whatWeOfferContent": "• Wide Range of Products: A growing selection across many categories from trusted sellers\n\n• Flexible Delivery: Express 30-minute (select areas), Next-Day and Standard delivery\n\n• Secure Payments: Pay online through a secure payment gateway, or choose Cash on Delivery where available\n\n• Easy Returns: Raise a return in the app for eligible items within the return window\n\n• Support: Write to us anytime and we will get back to you",
